00:09:07.860 --> 00:09:09.150
What was that pickle there?

00:09:09.150 --> 00:09:10.170
Mm, okay.

00:09:10.170 --> 00:09:12.990
- I wonder if Tucker's
gonna be like, what is that?

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:14.370
What?
- What?

00:09:14.370 --> 00:09:15.810
They're both breakfast deep.

00:09:15.810 --> 00:09:18.360
This is like your classic
waffle with the syrup.

00:09:18.360 --> 00:09:20.580
But this one is, you went
to IHOP and you said,

00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:22.650
