Chefs, please come in.

00:09:25.697 --> 00:09:26.530
Hello.
_ Hey.

00:09:28.110 --> 00:09:28.943
- What's happening here?

00:09:28.943 --> 00:09:30.720
- I'm dying to know who's the winner.

00:09:30.720 --> 00:09:32.509
- Okay, this is extremely hard.

00:09:32.509 --> 00:09:33.342
(drum rolls)

00:09:33.342 --> 00:09:34.740
Oh, and I think I have to go with this one

00:09:34.740 --> 00:09:39.740
